    "body": "I am on the Chrome team but am not as involved with Web Bluetooth as I have been in the past.\n\nAs much as it feels like shouting into the void please keep posting about the importance of fixing issues like this. It helps if you provide information about the application you are building and the company you work for so that we get a sense of the impact of missing features like this so we can prioritize.\n\nIf you're comfortable with C++ of course patches are welcome but our team will try to get to things like this. There are just so many features and so little time.",
