    "updated_at": "2025-10-13T17:24:28Z",
    "body": "Hi! Trying to understand the feature request here. If I understand correctly, platforms have their own internal timeout for connection attempts, for example Windows will time out after 7 seconds. MacOS is the outlier with not timeout. Is the feature request to be able to abort connections because MacOS has no timeout? Or are there issues on other platforms that make this feature useful there too?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
